    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no new story. that's the thing. when you've spent your whole life being someone who actually mattered, someone who was needed... you can't just pivot to being some guy who watches birds in the park. it feels hollow. like i've already finished my part and now i'm just an extra in a movie that’s already over.",
